description	"Nien Nunb

A scrappy, evasive class with many explosives, a launching Saber, and gadgets.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Nien's Wrench/Magna-Glove (Yellow Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- Chain Limit: 2
-- 125% more knockback
-- 35% shorter
-- 166% thicker
-- Saber Throw ^3[CS1]
--- 166% more damage
- DH-17 Blaster Pistol (Blaster Rifle 2)
-- 20% faster RoF
-- 20% less damage
- Pulse Cannon (Disruptor 2)
-- 25% faster RoF
-- 25% more damage
-- 10% faster reload
- Frag Grenades (3)
- Smuggler's Trip Mines (3)
-- Disarms on det
- Pulse Grenades (3)
- V-59 Conc Grenades (3)

^6Inventory:
- Stimpak
- Assault Sentry
- Cloaking Device (2)

^8Attributes:
- 35% more knockback taken
- 10% faster skill cooldown
- Getup (3)
- Dexterity (1)
- Battery Recharge (3)
- Blast Armor
- Healing (2)
- Huehuehue (Sense Immunity)

^3Abilities:
- Dash (2) ^3[CS2]
- Quick Throw (2) ^3[CS3]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS4]"